flowchart TD
 A[Case triggers preparation] --> B[Agent gathers context]
 B --> C{Facts complete?}
 C -->|no| Q[Persist question and wait]
 Q -->|authorized answer| B
 C -->|yes| T[Simulated evidence tool]
 T -->|receipt| P[Reviewable package]
 T -->|unavailable| E[Stop and preserve context]
 E -->|specialist retry once| B
 E -->|cancel| X[Cancelled]
 P --> H[Specialist review]
 H --> D[Approver decision]
 D -->|approve| Z[Decision recorded]
 D -->|return| Q
 H -->|requester revision invalidates review| B
